<title>HONG KONG: Yaohan Hongkong posts smaller H1 loss.</title>
<headline>Yaohan Hongkong posts smaller H1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   22.3 loss  vs 25.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.43	 vs 10.52</p>
<p>    Net			    80.45 loss vs 92.75 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,871.40   vs 1,632.41</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yaohan Hong Kong Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Yaohan Hongkong operates department stores. Exceptional item represents profit on sale of a residential property of the group.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
